msgctxt "96"
msgid ""
"Hirano-san's family pharmacy is located inside a nearby\r\n"
"shopping arcade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"I'll go look for Hirano-san. You try to explain the whole\r\n"
"situation to his parents, Kiryu-san! Thanks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san! Oh, I'm so glad you showed up! Remember me?\r\n"
"I'm the editor from Shonen Five!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Hey. Kind of surprised you really are waiting here for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Man, I can't believe I forgot to ask for your cell phone\r\n"
"number. Silly me! I was starting to give up hope on ever\r\n"
"seeing you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "So, how's our manga artist? Did you find Hirano's address?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "I did, there's just... one problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"Hirano-san's relatives aren't famous doctors, but\r\n"
"famous pharmacists."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Guess you had some wrong information, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Yeah, for sure. In any case, the Hirano family pharmacy is in that nearby "
"shopping arcade, but we may not want to head there just yet..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "Why, is there some sort of problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"Well, earlier, I thought I saw Hirano-san standing\r\n"
"in front of the train station. I think he's here in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"You sure it was him, and not someone who just looks\r\n"
"like him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"I'm sure of it. I wish I could've chased after him, but I\r\n"
"had to wait here, in case you showed up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"He was wearing that giant backpack he always wears.\r\n"
"There's no mistaking that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Fine, but even if that guy with the backpack was Hirano,\r\n"
"what's he doing in Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"I don't know, but he didn't look happy. I couldn't help\r\n"
"feeling even more worried about him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"I feel terrible asking you to do this, Kiryu-san, but\r\n"
"please, would you go meet with Hirano-san's family?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Does that mean you're going after Hirano?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"I know I should probably ask you to find Hirano-san, but...\r\n"
"I'm his editor. I've got to help him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"I don't think we could convince his parents of anything\r\n"
"if something terrible happened to Hirano-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Shouldn't you be more worried about getting Hirano-san's\r\n"
"manga serialized in Shonen Five?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"I'm more than just an editor, I'm a human being! And as a\r\n"
"human being, I've got to look out for one of my own!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"Besides, I'm the one who brought Hirano-san into the\r\n"
"wonderful world of manga."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"If something happened to Hirano-san... I don't think I\r\n"
"could ever be an editor again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"Damn. I thought you were only worried about your job, but\r\n"
"underneath all that, your spirit is manly as hell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "I'll look for Hirano-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Please explain the whole situation to Hirano-san's parents!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "All right, I will."
msgstr ""

